{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/overflow/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Overflow","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use these shorthand utilities for quickly configuring how content overflows an element."},"blocks":[{"id":"overflow","type":"heading","en":"Overflow","level":2},{"id":"overflow--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Adjust the <code>overflow</code> property on the fly with four default values and classes. These classes are not responsive by default."},{"id":"overflow--example-1","type":"demo","key":"aacdd176711b54c3c5a8","height":228},{"id":"overflow--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"overflow-auto\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-visible\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-scroll\">...</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"overflow-x","type":"heading","en":"<code>overflow-x</code>","level":3},{"id":"overflow-x--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Adjust the <code>overflow-x</code> property to affect the overflow of content horizontally."},{"id":"overflow-x--example-1","type":"demo","key":"bc4e941fde24344b302a","height":228},{"id":"overflow-x--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-hidden\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-visible\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-scroll\">...</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"overflow-y","type":"heading","en":"<code>overflow-y</code>","level":3},{"id":"overflow-y--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Adjust the <code>overflow-y</code> property to affect the overflow of content vertically."},{"id":"overflow-y--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b41f38e9900cb0a8bf00","height":228},{"id":"overflow-y--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"overflow-y-auto\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-y-hidden\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-y-visible\">...</div>\n<div class=\"overflow-y-scroll\">...</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"overflow-y--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Using Sass variables, you may customize the overflow utilities by changing the <code>$overflows</code> variable in <code>_variables.scss</code>."},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Overflow utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"overflow\": (\n  property: overflow,\n  values: auto hidden visible scroll,\n),\n\"overflow-x\": (\n  property: overflow-x,\n  values: auto hidden visible scroll,\n),\n\"overflow-y\": (\n  property: overflow-y,\n  values: auto hidden visible scroll,\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"aacdd176711b54c3c5a8","html":"<div class=\"overflow-auto p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary\" style=\"max-width: 260px; max-height: 100px;\"><p>This is an example of using <code>.overflow-auto</code> on an element with set width and height dimensions. By design, this content will vertically scroll.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary\" style=\"max-width: 260px; max-height: 100px;\"><p>This is an example of using <code>.overflow-hidden</code> on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-visible p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary\" style=\"max-width: 260px; max-height: 100px;\"><p>This is an example of using <code>.overflow-visible</code> on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-scroll p-3 bg-body-tertiary\" style=\"max-width: 260px; max-height: 100px;\"><p>This is an example of using <code>.overflow-scroll</code> on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-md-flex"},"sprite":""},{"key":"bc4e941fde24344b302a","html":"<div class=\"overflow-x-auto p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px; white-space: nowrap;\"><div><code>.overflow-x-auto</code> example on an element</div><div> with set width and height dimensions.</div></div><div class=\"overflow-x-hidden p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;white-space: nowrap;\"><div><code>.overflow-x-hidden</code> example</div><div>on an element with set width and height dimensions.</div></div><div class=\"overflow-x-visible p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;white-space: nowrap;\"><div><code>.overflow-x-visible</code> example </div><div>on an element with set width and height dimensions.</div></div><div class=\"overflow-x-scroll p-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;white-space: nowrap;\"><div><code>.overflow-x-scroll</code> example on an element</div><div> with set width and height dimensions.</div></div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-md-flex"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b41f38e9900cb0a8bf00","html":"<div class=\"overflow-y-auto p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;\"><p><code>.overflow-y-auto</code> example on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-y-hidden p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;\"><p><code>.overflow-y-hidden</code> example on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-y-visible p-3 mb-3 mb-md-0 me-md-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px;\"><p><code>.overflow-y-visible</code> example on an element with set width and height dimensions.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-y-scroll p-3 bg-body-tertiary w-100\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max